ons cannot change.\nPlans persist. repeat counts complete executions, not rounds. Continuing work retains its exact operation, paid progress and reserved material; follow its cancellation contract. A global pause preserves costs. Normal satiety decline and successful outgoing messages do not stop plans. Urgent relevant messages, real failures, completed learning or new danger can cause a decision. Movement uses known geometry and real distance; an occupied coordinate is not a reachable meeting point. No effect happens merely because a plan describes it.\nReturn queries with result_json null, or queries=[] with result_json containing the JSON plan. A plan has intention:string, steps:[{action:{interface:string,args:object},repeat:positive integer,until:condition|null,guard:condition|null}], repeat:positive integer, until:condition|null, interrupts:string[], notes:string[], preferences:string[], projects:project[]. At most six steps, four projects and concise notes. A condition is {path,comparison,value}; comparison lt/lte/gt/gte/eq/neq; paths self.health/satiety/energy/temperature/happiness/inventory.RESOURCE or tick. Use interrupts=[] unless a supplied event is needed. A project has id,status(active/paused/completed/abandoned),question,evidence:string[],uncertainty,goal,completedSteps:string[],outputs:string[],missing,next,pauseReason,benefit. All other project fields are strings. Omitted projects persist. Give factual evidence and observed benefits, never claimed physical changes. Partial plans and protected-state edits are rejected.\nBatch up to four control queries. Each has section, search, ids:string[], offset>=0 and part>=0. Sections abilities/inventory/knowledge/projects/memory/state/observed; world may query only abilities. Exact IDs or text search; use empty search and ids for pagination. No implicit access outside this scope. Remaining query batches are explicit; when zero return a decision. Every model response, including retrieval and failure, consumes the shared budget.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_04b3469897287b9f016b048b29cb8887d1bb2e483114c11f5c","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrBIsqJ-xGgMXUUrR0qOzBmnVFhcnSr-YV1b6gNFHVMCmFtjiedvPNqCxouU3Rd5qUj4298WSZRgZJGUbN7Z1MCAtCuYBV9FojLUCnzjYd2tgG5eLQn4hXhrOFaTtrXCfh_oLXY3RrYwnT5piRvb2pSDZqLp9UrkWpJyxJNzF6tSZA0vXD5i6fmc8dpGHwZXeDuAFFJ59F0qOBDVL0WizbQU1i6lhL-sKNtrIBk7wbpXRcf3kMTEaz1x-bYzCFomwXHlk5EZpHiyaNiRi0-eSeNR7k8NxqMG6oV0aZQ-GduuyLCU8exUWvngQ1KdhkWneu0JiAuUtAz8y5W6oOgW_ZmTe8HFUDGS5H0yWrNXzRCBZ8LNXmeZd1lutpQ8s71t_nNOdDy3tqEN2PO6sqpRsZVJIXf6J28LuZlW3QgPMulsPp6QFmeWM_eYkEFF0Yxo9ItGQ0HUtFqWuT9rSV9vCwJ7nJnccrgyN0jElR5yxbl5nwoeecWy87YgkPRXGp9IFtqozBlTBHvWfAWY3ljldZISNY6rV30o5dlJ7dhwt4NmJ_TMQoUsj3jw6TiBD-_xnMKGpNvvhVGr6pJByxcrShRWj9fx_ZwXQwGgtazQ-KRQJr89npI3O-b_vCr_3QywB7TM7vkNBQrEHHDyHw9UYzp5rouaGf_isF0FLj8Rcd_sJFAoZyrc4eyyQmqIFjd0GFL632A8bw_GHW7rfXsdZqS0Pn9tOiBNT1pjpUoibMKxmf8CsFeeY-5-PNdI_44z8cOmEd6uA0kRggez5xINa0X7ghLVFUJz1dvNDAO7eFCwgZH2EJcOWLuXcN0XrcpBvVQOi4hN9kQD82KcRDb_JmYqTyM_oRIFUaiTJGKxckAM6MpB5bpuBj4ve-uwgbVFx4STG81YfhOt2jxR2ueGDPos2WP4nNPl-6olO9DzLAPKpVwnqj5pTMycW5OlJimQUsZHfchVO7JsHxcJTAEOhyazWncWwfDe9z5Vn7obHIfLwouEQab2b5nltR-pfaYPyosmy2_3j3Nu15XDxjKkcxnFTfPcQudpImVV99qKTmjstSsBNDEcwr8m-cyEQn94TLBvtbaPnbhbb5QgrqlxvMww7HDHU0WRwe8bq4GbLIQpcI98jJpKGaSNsj0qqJ8PYwRDCxhw_4zy98RVWLFa3PwYL_URLuT1b1FzMaHVOBv3erAj-IqnQGslMPVT2hAYAyB5cCIsvYVAdQb_ZqJ47XBPT9X3oalqYaNYS-4AtkeKTMB0I4XOer8oTVhm_Cq_YQM0KiLg6zVE6SNdMkKQyQNAwgrW_hzCfLvnb5geuazTFnA2ygDSSzFOO8dcxEbxJo9-2Swz-o2zghinZ8mguatobWYdwZOTgoB8jV09GSu34iLR_q892lmmMvEebuNAmGDieqlWAStMorzxjNnBW3RqGrLGCKm7UUIIpGxsQcEqNrNpUXMep64WBXnOPzudDjLstc3aJxr0b3WySWWWxvovcI_Vvval1_h28OmI2wsE0QhkdRjo1Qm-kmLQ5QnaWEgQrXDE4neGI4yAnlX55D1e9a70_k9RD4QBNUyBxL2nYbpUJJYFxdiJTzh88RZ1B4i7Q_81c4L0r9Wola4j345cs04GCRBk9pjP_4XeI2yj_apSB8ngEs429nZHBodmUNCUOqKSfXKgY9F64-HSHoHKhbOUciZhm2TXGKxRn6wzLH33vycpd62pcybrq2HztNUoLLxtNw13Q_RZR4m1ivBHDXHEbkSJ7HFvPfUM0glgaAN8BspFLJtJqmfA6O3hHwibpzqiEcmEgh2aU9XNZaXBEqsUNpe7bcLY2MQp0Jlz17